cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "aihydro-tools: AI-Hydro MCP Server for Hydrological Research"
version: "1.7.0"
date-released: "2026-06-13"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AI-Hydro/aihydro-tools"
abstract: >
  aihydro-tools is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that gives AI agents
  access to 125+ typed hydrological research tools — watershed delineation,
  streamflow data retrieval, signature extraction, calibration, uncertainty
  quantification, and a claims/evidence defensibility layer. Every numeric
  result is traceable to a run_id, verifiable against session provenance, and
  exportable as a reproducible capsule.
authors:
